{
  "id": 21101,
  "entry": "inn",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "inn",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "坊市的夜里寻到此处，敢问你是问路，还是问人？\n泾川这些年不平静，水不对劲，人也不对劲。妖界如此，不知人间如何。\n红衣的女子？酒肆楼上窗边，常站着一位。\n戏班借行头，衣肆做衣裳，金银行打金器；酒肆生意只朝着有指望的做，不是贵宾可上不了楼的嘞。",
      "next": "end",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "apprentice",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "班子里的规矩就一条：上台的是我，台下的是你。\n都知管巡逻，乐正管台面。要入班，先验身。名册在都知手里。",
      "next": "end",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "theater_visitor",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "戏班重地，闲人止步。",
      "next": "end",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "theater_verify",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "学徒？名册上对一对。",
      "next": "end",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "theater_command",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "听都知的。",
      "next": "end",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "musician",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "琴不走调，手不能走。",
      "next": "end",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "patrol",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "今夜酒肆有贵客宴，二楼都清了场。",
      "next": "end",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "theater_perform",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "琴不走调，手不能走。",
      "next": "end",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "customer0",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "路过看看布。第一次来，没订过衣。",
      "next": "end",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "customer1",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "昨日订的。一件黑色长衫。订金已付。",
      "next": "end",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "customer2",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "我是陪人来的。我不取衣。",
      "next": "end",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "tailor_visitor",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "量衣，还是看布？",
      "next": "end",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "tailor_wrong",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "你身上没这单。",
      "next": "end",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "tailor_ready",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "黑色长衫，昨日订的，订金付过——可是你来取？",
      "next": "end",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "tailor_done",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "衣已经取走了。",
      "next": "end",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quota",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "按文书拨料：每件五份，库存二十四为限。文书在此，照单拨给。",
      "next": "end",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "forge_officer",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "文书对，料给您补足。",
      "next": "end",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "forge_smith",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "开工吧，三样都在单上。金襟扣、金带钩、金环扣。料不够，找官证补。",
      "next": "end",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "forge_visitor",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "不做生客的买卖。",
      "next": "end",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "guest",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "进来的不图个喝酒，图什么劳什子？主人平日不下楼——你问我？天晓得啥时候下来。坐下，喝一杯。",
      "next": "end",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "boss_guest",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "客从何处来？",
      "next": "end",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "boss_visitor",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "你坐的位置不对。",
      "next": "end",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "customer_a",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "不喝就是看不起我。来来来。",
      "next": "end",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "customer_a_drunk",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "……你、你问什么？楼上今晚清了场，有贵客。",
      "next": "end",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "customer_b",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "小酌一口，多的不敢。别问我。",
      "next": "end",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "customer_b_drunk",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "红衣裳……楼上……窗边的人影，这几夜都在。",
      "next": "end",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "generic",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "找我有什么事？",
      "next": "end",
      "outcome": "",
